{"nodes": [{"id": "duc_dashboard_html", "label": "duc-dashboard.html", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "duc-dashboard.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "duc_dashboard_rationale_scope", "label": "duc-dashboard.html scope & deliberate omissions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "duc-dashboard.html", "source_location": "lines 11-48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "duc-dashboard.html is the static-Supabase replacement for the legacy Google Apps Script 'B\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n \u0111\u00fac' Index.html screen only. Other original screens (IPQC submission, QC manager, NCP detail, mobile, weekly plan) live in separate files. Deliberately omitted: (1) ensurePersonnelInMaster_ auto-write of hand-typed personnel names back to KHSX Master \u2014 free-text names still save fine, just no future autosuggest outside the session; (2) the entire NCP (non-conforming product) flow \u2014 original Index.html had no entry point for it; (3) IPQC result submission form/standard management \u2014 original only shows a 'waiting IPQC' badge sourced from duc_get_ipqc_due_by_id_dong; (4) Google Docs->PDF end-shift report replaced with in-browser window.print()+@media print from duc_end_shift data; (5) Google Sheet weekly report replaced by client-side HTML summary table aggregated from duc_lich_su_san_xuat (only closed shifts appear); (6) duc_acquire_lock/duc_release_lock exist server-side but were never called by original Index.html, so left unwired; (7) '\u26a1 N\u1ea1p k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch t\u1eeb KHSX tu\u1ea7n' was restored, reading duc_khsx_tuan_plan (entered via khsx-tuan.html) instead of the original Google Sheet."}, {"id": "duc_dashboard_bootstrap", "label": "bootstrap()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "duc-dashboard.html", "source_location": "line 1338", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "c